2026-09-07T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2235) 'MCP tools answer one call and forget it, so an agent driven through them loses the turn's context. Taskweft had a planner and no executor.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2235  1 LINE
